 their jurisdictions  in other words if a school's in  henderson flashing lights are controlled  by henderson  same for north las vegas and for las  vegas in other words there is no  one entity that controls the flashers  for all schools in the school district  how about that so to learn which  campuses are food distribution sites and  may have flashing lights now  we've got a link to not only the sites  but also their menus  back to you all right thanks nate we put  all that info in our back to school  section  it's over on eight newsnow.com well some  students will  physically return to the classroom up  next in our back to school special we'll  look at the rules and precautions being  taken  at various private and charter schools  plus what will school athletics look  like this year if there  are any we take a look at how football  and basketball teams are expected to  play out the remainder of this year

